{"input_path": "input/ipas中級_科目2_大數據處理分析與應用_imgs/page_0040.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 2382, "height": 3368, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "第三章 機率統計基礎", "block_bbox": [1558, 207, 2080, 261], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1558.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 261.0], [1558.0, 261.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（1）平均數的差異檢定", "block_bbox": [294, 401, 818, 464], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[294.0, 401.0], [818.0, 401.0], [818.0, 464.0], [294.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "單樣本 t 檢定（One-sample t-test）", "block_bbox": [400, 502, 1208, 562], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[400.0, 502.0], [1208.0, 502.0], [1208.0, 562.0], [400.0, 562.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "a. 方法概述", "block_bbox": [468, 603, 752, 662], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[468.0, 603.0], [752.0, 603.0], [752.0, 662.0], [468.0, 662.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "單樣本t檢定是用來檢驗「樣本平均數是否與某個已知數值（ $ \\mu_{0} $）之間存在顯著差異」的方法。當母體標準差未知，且樣本數較小（n<30）時，通常採用此檢定。", "block_bbox": [534, 701, 2086, 963], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 701.0], [2086.0, 701.0], [2086.0, 963.0], [534.0, 963.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "常見於產品測試、教育成績評估、臨床實驗等領域，例如：檢查某藥物對血壓是否有降低效果、驗證學生考試成績是否達標。", "block_bbox": [534, 1000, 2080, 1160], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 1000.0], [2080.0, 1000.0], [2080.0, 1160.0], [534.0, 1160.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "b. 適用條件與前提假設", "block_bbox": [468, 1198, 1006, 1258], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[468.0, 1198.0], [1006.0, 1198.0], [1006.0, 1258.0], [468.0, 1258.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在使用單樣本t檢定之前，必須確保下列條件成立：", "block_bbox": [533, 1298, 1739, 1356], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 1298.0], [1739.0, 1298.0], [1739.0, 1356.0], [533.0, 1356.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [504, 1408, 592, 1499], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[504.0, 1408.0], [592.0, 1408.0], [592.0, 1499.0], [504.0, 1499.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○資料為連續變數（如長度、時間、成績等）。", "block_bbox": [594, 1395, 1644, 1453], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[594.0, 1395.0], [1644.0, 1395.0], [1644.0, 1453.0], [594.0, 1453.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○ 樣本為隨機抽樣，且彼此獨立。", "block_bbox": [595, 1492, 1367, 1551], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[595.0, 1492.0], [1367.0, 1492.0], [1367.0, 1551.0], [595.0, 1551.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○ 母體標準差未知。", "block_bbox": [595, 1592, 1066, 1649], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[595.0, 1592.0], [1066.0, 1592.0], [1066.0, 1649.0], [595.0, 1649.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "○ 樣本來自近似常態分佈的母體（若  $ n \\geq 30 $，可依中央極限定理放寬常態性要求）。", "block_bbox": [594, 1689, 2079, 1847], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[594.0, 1689.0], [2079.0, 1689.0], [2079.0, 1847.0], [594.0, 1847.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "c. 假設設定", "block_bbox": [471, 1888, 753, 1948], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[471.0, 1888.0], [753.0, 1888.0], [753.0, 1948.0], [471.0, 1948.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 虛無假設（H₀）：μ = μ₀（樣本平均與理論值無差異）。", "block_bbox": [534, 1986, 1778, 2048], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 1986.0], [1778.0, 1986.0], [1778.0, 2048.0], [534.0, 2048.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 對立假設（H $ _{1} $）依檢定方向不同，可分為三種：", "block_bbox": [534, 2085, 1652, 2147], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 2085.0], [1652.0, 2085.0], [1652.0, 2147.0], [534.0, 2147.0]]}, {"block_label": "table", "block_content": "<table><tr><td>檢定類型</td><td>對立假設  $ H_{1} $</td><td>應用時機</td></tr><tr><td>雙尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu \\neq \\mu_{0} $</td><td>想知道是否有「差異」（不論方向）</td></tr><tr><td>左尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu < \\mu_{0} $</td><td>想確認是否「變小」或「變差」</td></tr><tr><td>右尾檢定</td><td>$ \\mu > \\mu_{0} $</td><td>想確認是否「變大」或「改善」</td></tr></table>", "block_bbox": [307, 2179, 2072, 2534], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 2179.0], [2072.0, 2179.0], [2072.0, 2534.0], [307.0, 2534.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "舉例來說，若要檢驗某食品的平均含鈉量是否與法規標準不同，適用雙尾檢定；若想確認藥物是否讓血壓下降，則採用左尾檢定。", "block_bbox": [350, 2611, 2083, 2772], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[350.0, 2611.0], [2083.0, 2611.0], [2083.0, 2772.0], [350.0, 2772.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "d. 常見誤用與注意事項", "block_bbox": [468, 2843, 1005, 2901], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[468.0, 2843.0], [1005.0, 2843.0], [1005.0, 2901.0], [468.0, 2901.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "■ 不適用於比例、名目或順序型資料（例如：性別、等級）。", "block_bbox": [533, 2944, 1878, 3002], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[533.0, 2944.0], [1878.0, 2944.0], [1878.0, 3002.0], [533.0, 3002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "若母體標準差已知，應使用 Z 檢定而非 t 檢定。", "block_bbox": [534, 3044, 1648, 3103], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[534.0, 3044.0], [1648.0, 3044.0], [1648.0, 3103.0], [534.0, 3103.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "3-33", "block_bbox": [2101, 3189, 2198, 3231], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[2101.0, 3189.0], [2198.0, 3189.0], [2198.0, 3231.0], [2101.0, 3231.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_index": null, "boxes": [{"cls_id": 12, "label": "header", "score": 0.8678290247917175, "coordinate": [1558, 207, 2080, 261], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1558.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 207.0], [2080.0, 261.0], [1558.0, 261.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7536319494247437, "coordinate": [294, 401, 818, 464], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[294.0, 401.0], [818.0, 401.0], [818.0, 464.0], [294.0, 464.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8410859704017639, "coordinate": [400, 502, 1208, 562], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[400.0, 502.0], [1208.0, 502.0], [1208.0, 562.0], [400.0, 562.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7915725111961365, "coordinate": [468, 603, 752, 662], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[468.0, 603.0], [752.0, 603.0], [752.0, 662.0], [468.0, 662.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9436498880386353, "coordinate": [534, 701, 2086, 963], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 701.0], [2086.0, 701.0], [2086.0, 963.0], [534.0, 963.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9314686059951782, "coordinate": [534, 1000, 2080, 1160], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 1000.0], [2080.0, 1000.0], [2080.0, 1160.0], [534.0, 1160.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8326036334037781, "coordinate": [468, 1198, 1006, 1258], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[468.0, 1198.0], [1006.0, 1198.0], [1006.0, 1258.0], [468.0, 1258.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.853475034236908, "coordinate": [533, 1298, 1739, 1356], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 1298.0], [1739.0, 1298.0], [1739.0, 1356.0], [533.0, 1356.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.3146948218345642, "coordinate": [504, 1408, 592, 1499], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[504.0, 1408.0], [592.0, 1408.0], [592.0, 1499.0], [504.0, 1499.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8337411880493164, "coordinate": [594, 1395, 1644, 1453], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[594.0, 1395.0], [1644.0, 1395.0], [1644.0, 1453.0], [594.0, 1453.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8231217265129089, "coordinate": [595, 1492, 1367, 1551], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[595.0, 1492.0], [1367.0, 1492.0], [1367.0, 1551.0], [595.0, 1551.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8228524327278137, "coordinate": [595, 1592, 1066, 1649], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[595.0, 1592.0], [1066.0, 1592.0], [1066.0, 1649.0], [595.0, 1649.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9196231365203857, "coordinate": [594, 1689, 2079, 1847], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[594.0, 1689.0], [2079.0, 1689.0], [2079.0, 1847.0], [594.0, 1847.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.617865800857544, "coordinate": [471, 1888, 753, 1948], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[471.0, 1888.0], [753.0, 1888.0], [753.0, 1948.0], [471.0, 1948.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8508284091949463, "coordinate": [534, 1986, 1778, 2048], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 1986.0], [1778.0, 1986.0], [1778.0, 2048.0], [534.0, 2048.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8682602643966675, "coordinate": [534, 2085, 1652, 2147], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 2085.0], [1652.0, 2085.0], [1652.0, 2147.0], [534.0, 2147.0]]}, {"cls_id": 21, "label": "table", "score": 0.9656767845153809, "coordinate": [307, 2179, 2072, 2534], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 2179.0], [2072.0, 2179.0], [2072.0, 2534.0], [307.0, 2534.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9357755184173584, "coordinate": [350, 2611, 2083, 2772], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[350.0, 2611.0], [2083.0, 2611.0], [2083.0, 2772.0], [350.0, 2772.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.4920852780342102, "coordinate": [468, 2843, 1005, 2901], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[468.0, 2843.0], [1005.0, 2843.0], [1005.0, 2901.0], [468.0, 2901.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8540918827056885, "coordinate": [533, 2944, 1878, 3002], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[533.0, 2944.0], [1878.0, 2944.0], [1878.0, 3002.0], [533.0, 3002.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8541287183761597, "coordinate": [534, 3044, 1648, 3103], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[534.0, 3044.0], [1648.0, 3044.0], [1648.0, 3103.0], [534.0, 3103.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7279067635536194, "coordinate": [2101, 3189, 2198, 3231], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[2101.0, 3189.0], [2198.0, 3189.0], [2198.0, 3231.0], [2101.0, 3231.0]]}]}}